rt": 80.26, "end": 80.42}, {"text": "was", "start": 80.42, "end": 80.54}, {"text": "assigned", "start": 80.54, "end": 80.9}, {"text": "to,", "start": 80.9, "end": 81.26}]}, {"id": 31, "startTime": 81.52, "endTime": 83.32, "fullText": "and where the power feed should be connected.", "words": [{"text": "and", "start": 81.52, "end": 81.7}, {"text": "where", "start": 81.7, "end": 81.82}, {"text": "the", "start": 81.82, "end": 81.96}, {"text": "power", "start": 81.96, "end": 82.28}, {"text": "feed", "start": 82.28, "end": 82.58}, {"text": "should", "start": 82.58, "end": 82.8}, {"text": "be", "start": 82.8, "end": 82.94}, {"text": "connected.", "start": 82.94, "end": 83.32}]}, {"id": 32, "startTime": 83.32, "endTime": 86.26, "fullText": "It seemed somehow unnaturally dark and silent,", "words": [{"text": "It", "start": 83.32, "end": 84.04}, {"text": "seemed", "start": 84.04, "end": 84.3}, {"text": "somehow", "start": 84.3, "end": 84.58}, {"text": "unnaturally", "start": 84.58, "end": 85.16}, {"text": "dark", "start": 85.16, "end": 85.52}, {"text": "and", "start": 85.52, "end": 85.74}, {"text": "silent,", "start": 85.74, "end": 86.26}]}, {"id": 33, "startTime": 86.6, "endTime": 88.54, "fullText": "Even for a ship whose two-man crew was at", "words": [{"text": "Even", "start": 86.6, "end": 86.7}, {"text": "for", "start": 86.7, "end": 86.92}, {"text": "a", "start": 86.92, "end": 87.06}, {"text": "ship", "start": 87.06, "end": 87.26}, {"text": "whose", "start": 87.26, "end": 87.5}, {"text": "two-man", "start": 87.5, "end": 87.9}, {"text": "crew", "start": 87.9, "end": 88.16}, {"text": "was", "start": 88.16, "end": 88.4}, {"text": "at", "start": 88.4, "end": 88.54}]}, {"id": 34, "startTime": 88.54, "endTime": 92.38, "fullText": "that moment lying asphyxicated in a smoke-filled chamber several", "words": [{"text": "that", "start": 88.54, "end": 88.66}, {"text": "moment", "start": 88.66, "end": 89.0}, {"text": "lying", "start": 89.0, "end": 89.32}, {"text": "asphyxicated", "start": 89.32, "end": 90.12}, {"text": "in", "start": 90.12, "end": 90.34}, {"text": "a", "start": 90.34, "end": 90.52}, {"text": "smoke-filled", "start": 91.08, "end": 91.54}, {"text": "chamber", "start": 91.54, "end": 91.94}, {"text": "several", "start": 91.94, "end": 92.38}]}, {"id": 35, "startTime": 92.38, "endTime": 93.82, "fullText": "miles beneath the ground.", "words": [{"text": "miles", "start": 92.38, "end": 92.76}, {"text": "beneath", "start": 92.76, "end": 93.12}, {"text": "the", "start": 93.12, "end": 93.34}, {"text": "ground.", "start": 93.34, "end": 93.82}]}, {"id": 36, "startTime": 93.82, "endTime": 95.87, "fullText": "It is one of those curious things that is", "words": [{"text": "It", "start": 93.82, "end": 94.28}, {"text": "is", "start": 94.28, "end": 94.42}, {"text": "one", "start": 94.42, "end": 94.56}, {"text": "of", "start": 94.56, "end": 94.66}, {"text": "those", "start": 94.66, "end": 94.78}, {"text": "curious", "start": 94.78, "end": 95.14}, {"text": "things", "start": 95.14, "end": 95.52}, {"text": "that", "start": 95.09, "end": 95.77}, {"text": "is", "start": 95.77, "end": 95.87}]}, {"id": 37, "startTime": 95.87, "endTime": 99.19, "fullText": "impossible to explain or define, but one can sense", "words": [{"text": "impossible", "start": 95.87, "end": 96.33}, {"text": "to", "start": 96.33, "end": 96.73}, {"text": "explain", "start": 96.73, "end": 97.19}, {"text": "or", "start": 97.19, "end": 97.51}, {"text": "define,", "start": 97.51, "end": 98.15}, {"text": "but", "start": 98.15, "end": 98.57}, {"text": "one", "start": 98.57, "end": 98.73}, {"text": "can", "start": 98.73, "end": 98.93}, {"text": "sense", "start": 98.93, "end": 99.19}]}, {"id": 38, "startTime": 99.19, "endTime": 100.87, "fullText": "when a ship is completely dead.", "words": [{"text": "when", "start": 99.19, "end": 99.37}, {"text": "a", "start": 99.37, "end": 99.47}, {"text": "ship", "start": 99.47, "end": 99.67}, {"text": "is", "start": 99.67, "end": 99.89}, {"text": "completely", "start": 99.89, "end": 100.25}, {"text": "dead.", "start": 100.25, "end": 100.87}]}, {"id": 39, "startTime": 101.29, "endTime": 103.55, "fullText": "Ford could sense it and found it most mysterious.", "words": [{"text": "Ford", "start": 101.29, "end": 101.49}, {"text": "could", "start": 101.49, "end": 101.71}, {"text": "sense", "start": 101.71, "end": 101.99}, {"text": "it", "start": 101.99, "end": 102.15}, {"text": "and", "start": 102.15, "end": 102.37}, {"text": "found", "start": 102.37, "end": 102.65}, {"text": "it", "start": 102.65, "end": 102.79}, {"text": "most", "start": 102.79, "end": 103.05}, {"text": "mysterious.", "start": 103.05, "end": 103.55}]}, {"id": 40, "startTime": 103.55, "endTime": 106.15, "fullText": "A ship and two policemen seemed to have gone", "words": [{"text": "A", "start": 103.55, "end": 104.21}, {"text": "ship", "start": 104.21, "end": 104.45}, {"text": "and", "start": 104.45, "end": 104.67}, {"text": "two", "start": 104.67, "end": 104.87}, {"text": "policemen", "start": 104.87, "end": 105.29}, {"text": "seemed", "start": 105.29, "end": 105.65}, {"text": "to", "start": 105.65, "end": 105.85}, {"text": "have", "start": 105.85, "end": 105.97}, {"text": "gone", "start": 105.97, "end": 106.15}]}, {"id": 41, "startTime": 105.71, "endTime": 109.89, "fullText": "spontaneously dead. In his experience, the universe simply", "words": [{"text": "spontaneously", "start": 105.71, "end": 106.89}, {"text": "dead.", "start": 106.89, "end": 107.61}, {"text": "In", "start": 107.61, "end": 108.07}, {"text": "his", "start": 108.07, "end": 108.19}, {"text": "experience,", "start": 108.19, "end": 108.91}, {"text": "the", "start": 108.91, "end": 109.03}, {"text": "universe", "start": 109.03, "end": 109.37}, {"text": "simply", "start": 109.37, "end": 109.89}]}, {"id": 42, "startTime": 109.89, "endTime": 110.93, "fullText": "didn't work like that.", "words": [{"text": "didn't", "start": 109.89, "end": 110.21}, {"text": "work", "start": 110.21, "end": 110.41}, {"text": "like", "start": 110.41, "end": 110.63}, {"text": "that.", "start": 110.63, "end": 110.93}]}, {"id": 43, "startTime": 111.39, "endTime": 113.05, "fullText": "The other three could sense it too,", "words": [{"text": "The", "start": 111.39, "end": 111.57}, {"text": "other", "start": 111.57, "end": 111.73}, {"text": "three", "start": 111.73, "end": 111.97}, {"text": "could", "start": 111.97, "end": 112.23}, {"text": "sense", "start": 112.23, "end": 112.47}, {"text": "it", "start": 112.47, "end": 112.63}, {"text": "too,", "start": 112.63, "end": 113.05}]}, {"id": 44, "startTime": 113.05, "endTime": 115.19, "fullText": "but they could sense the bitter cold even more", "words": [{"text": "but", "start": 113.05, "end": 113.39}, {"text": "they", "start": 113.39, "end": 113.53}, {"text": "could", "start": 113.53, "end": 113.63}, {"text": "sense", "start": 113.63, "end": 113.89}, {"text": "the", "start": 113.89, "end": 114.07}, {"text": "bitter", "start": 114.07, "end": 114.27}, {"text": "cold", "start": 114.27, "end": 114.55}, {"text": "even", "start": 114.55, "end": 114.87}, {"text": "more", "start": 114.87, "end": 115.19}]}, {"id": 45, "startTime": 115.19, "endTime": 117.41, "fullText": "and hurry back into the Heart of Gold suffering", "words": [{"text": "and", "start": 115.19, "end": 115.41}, {"text": "hurry", "start": 115.41, "end": 115.67}, {"text": "back", "start": 115.69, "end": 115.93}, {"text": "into", "start": 115.93, "end": 116.19}, {"text": "the", "start": 116.19, "end": 116.35}, {"text": "Heart", "start": 116.35, "end": 116.53}, {"text": "of", "start": 116.53, "end": 116.69}, {"text": "Gold", "start": 116.69, "end": 116.97}, {"text": "suffering", "start": 116.97, "end": 117.41}]}, {"id": 46, "startTime": 117.41, "endTime": 120.03, "fullText": "from an acute attack of no curiosity.", "words": [{"text": "from", "start": 117.41, "end": 117.69}, {"text": "an", "start": 117.69, "end": 117.77}, {"text": "acute", "start": 117.77, "end": 118.03}, {"text": "attack", "start": 118.03, "end": 118.37}, {"text": "of", "start": 118.37, "end": 118.57}, {"text": "no", "start": 118.57, "end": 118.73}, {"text": "curiosity.", "start": 118.73, "end": 120.03}]}, {"id": 47, "startTime": 120.03, "endTime": 123.27, "fullText": "Ford stayed and went to examine the Blagulant ship.", "words": [{"text": "Ford", "start": 120.03, "end": 120.19}, {"text": "stayed", "start": 120.19, "end": 120.55}, {"text": "and", "start": 120.55, "end": 121.03}, {"text": "went", "start": 120.95, "end": 121.23}, {"text": "to", "start": 121.23, "end": 121.33}, {"text": "examine", "start": 121.33, "end": 121.73}, {"text": "the", "start": 121.73, "end": 121.95}, {"text": "Blagulant", "start": 121.95, "end": 122.41}, {"text": "ship.", "start": 122.41, "end": 123.27}]}, {"id": 48, "startTime": 123.27, "endTime": 125.47, "fullText": "As he walked, he nearly tripped over an inert", "words": [{"text": "As", "start": 123.27, "end": 123.39}, {"text": "he", "start": 123.39, "end": 123.51}, {"text": "walked,", "start": 123.51, "end": 124.03}, {"text": "he", "start": 124.03, "end": 124.13}, {"text": "nearly", "start": 124.13, "end": 124.37}, {"text": "tripped", "start": 124.37, "end": 124.71}, {"text": "over", "start": 124.71, "end": 124.99}, {"text": "an", "start": 124.99, "end": 125.17}, {"text": "inert", "start": 125.17, "end": 125.47}]}, {"id": 49, "startTime": 125.47, "endTime": 128.33, "fullText": "steel figure lying face down in the cold dust.", "words": [{"text": "steel", "start": 125.47, "end": 125.79}, {"text": "figure", "start": 125.79, "end": 126.15}, {"text": "lying", "start": 126.15, "end": 126.45}, {"text": "face", "start": 126.25, "end": 126.85}, {"text": "down", "start": 126.85, "end": 127.07}, {"text": "in", "start": 127.07, "end": 127.23}, {"text": "the", "start": 127.23, "end": 127.33}, {"text": "cold", "start": 127.33, "end": 127.55}, {"text": "dust.", "start": 127.55, "end": 128.33}]}, {"id": 50, "startTime": 128.33, "endTime": 131.11, "fullText": "Marvin, he exclaimed. What are you doing?", "words": [{"text": "Marvin,", "start": 128.33, "end": 129.23}, {"text": "he", "start": 129.23, "end": 129.35}, {"text": "exclaimed.", "start": 129.35, "end": 130.07}, {"text": "What", "start": 130.07, "end": 130.47}, {"text": "are", "start": 130.47, "end": 130.57}, {"text": "you", "start": 130.57, "end": 130.67}, {"text": "doing?", "start": 130.67, "end": 131.11}]}, {"id": 51, "startTime": 131.11, "endTime": 133.05, "fullText": "Don't feel you have to take any notice of", "words": [{"text": "Don't", "start": 131.11, "end": 131.53}, {"text": "feel", "start": 131.53, "end": 131.73}, {"text": "you", "start": 131.73, "end": 131.87}, {"text": "have", "start": 131.87, "end": 132.03}, {"text": "to", "start": 132.03, "end": 132.17}, {"text": "take", "start": 132.17, "end": 132.35}, {"text": "any", "start": 131.89, "end": 132.57}, {"text": "notice", "start": 132.57, "end": 132.83}, {"text": "of", "start": 132.83, "end": 133.05}]}, {"id": 52, "startTime": 133.05, "endTime": 135.53, "fullText": "me, please, came a muffled drone.", "words": [{"text": "me,", "start": 133.05, "end": 133.61}, {"text": "please,", "start": 133.61, "end": 134.17}, {"text": "came", "start": 134.17, "end": 134.43}, {"text": "a", "start": 134.43, "end": 134.55}, {"text": "muffled", "start": 134.55, "end": 134.81}, {"text": "drone.", "start": 134.81, "end": 135.53}]}, {"id": 53, "startTime": 135.53, "endTime": 137.45, "fullText": "But how are you, Meadowlan, said Ford.", "words": [{"text": "But", "start": 135.53, "end": 135.75}, {"text": "how", "start": 135.75, "end": 135.89}, {"text": "are", "start": 135.89, "end": 136.03}, {"text": "you,", "start": 136.03, "end": 136.27}, {"text": "Meadowlan,", "start": 136.27, "end": 136.75}, {"text": "said", "start": 136.75, "end": 136.91}, {"text": "Ford.", "start": 136.91, "end": 137.45}]}, {"id": 54, "startTime": 137.45, "endTime": 139.53, "fullText": "Very depressed. What's up?", "words": [{"text": "Very", "start": 137.45, "end": 137.93}, {"text": "depressed.", "start": 137.77, "end": 139.05}, {"text": "What's", "start": 139.05, "end": 139.25}, {"text": "up?", "start": 139.25, "end": 139.53}]}, {"id": 55, "startTime": 139.53, "endTime": 141.33, "fullText": "I don't know, said Marvin.", "words": [{"text": "I", "start": 139.53, "end": 139.93}, {"text": "don't", "start": 139.93, "end": 140.11}, {"text": "know,", "start": 140.11, "end": 140.59}, {"text": "said", "start": 140.59, "end": 140.73}, {"text": "Marvin.", "start": 140.73, "end": 141.33}]}, {"id": 56, "startTime": 141.33, "endTime": 142.41, "fullText": "I've never been there.", "words": [{"text": "I've", "start": 141.33, "end": 141.57}, {"text": "never", "start": 141.57, "end": 141.75}, {"text": "been", "start": 141.75, "end": 141.95}, {"text": "there.", "start": 141.95, "end": 142.41}]}, {"id": 57, "startTime": 142.41, "endTime": 145.51, "fullText": "Why, said Ford squatting down beside him and shivering.", "words": [{"text": "Why,", "start": 142.41, "end": 143.05}, {"text": "said", "start": 143.05, "end": 143.19}, {"text": "Ford", "start": 143.19, "end": 143.49}, {"text": "squatting", "start": 143.49, "end": 143.95}, {"text": "down", "start": 143.97, "end": 144.13}, {"text": "beside", "start": 144.13, "end": 144.47}, {"text": "him", "start": 144.47, "end": 144.79}, {"text": "and", "start": 144.79, "end": 144.95}, {"text": "shivering.", "start": 144.95, "end": 145.51}]}, {"id": 58, "startTime": 145.51, "endTime": 147.43, "fullText": "Are you lying face down in the dust?", "words": [{"text": "Are", "start": 145.51, "end": 145.77}, {"text": "you", "start": 145.77, "end": 145.91}, {"text": "lying", "start": 145.91, "end": 146.15}, {"text": "face", "start": 146.15, "end": 146.41}, {"text": "down", "start": 146.41, "end": 146.65}, {"text": "in", "start": 146.65, "end": 146.81}, {"text": "the", "start": 146.81, "end": 146.91}, {"text": "dust?", "start": 146.91, "end": 147.43}]}, {"id": 59, "startTime": 147.43, "endTime": 149.87, "fullText": "It's a very effective way of being wretched,", "words": [{"text": "It's", "start": 147.43, "end": 147.93}, {"text": "a", "start": 147.93, "end": 148.01}, {"text": "very", "start": 148.01, "end": 148.29}, {"text": "effective", "start": 148.29, "end": 148.63}, {"text": "way", "start": 148.63, "end": 148.95}, {"text": "of", "start": 148.95, "end": 149.07}, {"text": "being", "start": 148.63, "end": 149.33}, {"text": "wretched,", "start": 149.33, "end": 149.87}]}, {"id": 60, "startTime": 149.87, "endTime": 151.93, "fullText": "said Marvin. Don't pretend you want to talk to", "words": [{"text": "said", "start": 149.87, "end": 150.03}, {"text": "Marvin.", "start": 150.03, "end": 150.75}, {"text": "Don't", "start": 150.75, "end": 151.05}, {"text": "pretend", "start": 151.05, "end": 151.33}, {"text": "you", "start": 151.33, "end": 151.47}, {"text": "want", "start": 151.47, "end": 151.57}, {"text": "to", "start": 151.57, "end": 151.65}, {"text": "talk", "start": 151.65, "end": 151.83}, {"text": "to", "start": 151.83, "end": 151.93}]}, {"id": 61, "startTime": 151.93, "endTime": 153.29, "fullText": "me. I know you hate me.", "words": [{"text": "me.", "start": 151.93, "end": 152.21}, {"text": "I", "start": 152.21, "end": 152.47}, {"text": "know", "start": 152.47, "end": 152.63}, {"text": "you", "start": 152.63, "end": 152.81}, {"text": "hate", "start": 152.81, "end": 153.03}, {"text": "me.", "start": 153.03, "end": 153.29}]}, {"id": 62, "startTime": 153.29, "endTime": 155.47, "fullText": "No, I don't. Yes, you do.", "words": [{"text": "No,", "start": 153.29, "end": 153.87}, {"text": "I", "start": 153.87, "end": 153.99}, {"text": "don't.", "start": 153.99, "end": 154.45}, {"text": "Yes,", "start": 154.73, "end": 154.93}, {"text": "you", "start": 154.93, "end": 155.07}, {"text": "do.", "start": 155.07, "end": 155.47}]}, {"id": 63, "startTime": 155.47, "endTime": 157.83, "fullText": "Everybody does. It's part of the shape of the", "words": [{"text": "Everybody", "start": 155.47, "end": 155.83}, {"text": "does.", "start": 155.83, "end": 156.43}, {"text": "It's", "start": 156.43, "end": 156.95}, {"text": "part", "start": 156.95, "end": 157.13}, {"text": "of", "start": 157.13, "end": 157.25}, {"text": "the", "start": 157.25, "end": 157.35}, {"text": "shape", "start": 157.35, "end": 157.57}, {"text": "of", "start": 157.57, "end": 157.73}, {"text": "the", "start": 157.73, "end": 157.83}]}, {"id": 64, "startTime": 157.83, "endTime": 160.39, "fullText": "universe. I only have to talk to somebody and", "words": [{"text": "universe.", "start": 157.83, "end": 158.13}, {"text": "I", "start": 158.13, "end": 158.99}, {"text": "only", "start": 158.99, "end": 159.19}, {"text": "have", "start": 159.19, "end": 159.37}, {"text": "to", "start": 159.37, "end": 159.49}, {"text": "talk", "start": 159.49, "end": 159.63}, {"text": "to", "start": 159.63, "end": 159.75}, {"text": "somebody", "start": 159.31, "end": 160.11}, {"text": "and", "start": 160.11, "end": 160.39}]}, {"id": 65, "startTime": 160.39, "endTime": 161.35, "fullText": "they begin to hate me.", "words": [{"text": "they", "start": 160.39, "end": 160.49}, {"text": "begin", "start": 160.49, "end": 160.73}, {"text": "to", "start": 160.73, "end": 160.87}, {"text": "hate", "start": 160.87, "end": 161.01}, {"text": "me.", "start": 161.01, "end": 161.35}]}, {"id": 66, "startTime": 161.35, "endTime": 162.83, "fullText": "Even robots hate me.", "words": [{"text": "Even", "start": 161.35, "end": 161.85}, {"text": "robots", "start": 161.85, "end": 162.25}, {"text": "hate", "start": 162.25, "end": 162.51}, {"text": "me.", "start": 162.51, "end": 162.83}]}, {"id": 67, "startTime": 162.83, "endTime": 164.87, "fullText": "If you just ignore me, I expect I shall", "words": [{"text": "If", "start": 162.83, "end": 163.27}, {"text": "you", "start": 163.27, "end": 163.35}, {"text": "just", "start": 163.35, "end": 163.53}, {"text": "ignore", "start": 163.53, "end": 163.79}, {"text": "me,", "start": 163.79, "end": 164.13}, {"text": "I", "start": 164.13, "end": 164.19}, {"text": "expect", "start": 164.19, "end": 164.47}, {"text": "I", "start": 164.47, "end": 164.71}, {"text": "shall", "start": 164.71, "end": 164.87}]}, {"id": 68, "startTime": 164.39, "endTime": 167.51, "fullText": "probably go away. He jacked himself up to his", "words": [{"text": "probably", "start": 164.39, "end": 165.31}, {"text": "go", "start": 165.31, "end": 165.55}, {"text": "away.", "start": 165.55, "end": 166.07}, {"text": "He", "start": 166.07, "end": 166.49}, {"text": "jacked", "start": 166.49, "end": 166.79}, {"text": "himself", "start": 166.79, "end": 167.01}, {"text": "up", "start": 167.01, "end": 167.27}, {"text": "to", "start": 167.27, "end": 167.37}, {"text": "his", "start": 167.37, "end": 167.51}]}, {"id": 69, "startTime": 167.51, "endTime": 170.89, "fullText": "feet and stood resolutely facing the opposite direction.", "words": [{"text": "feet", "start": 167.51, "end": 167.77}, {"text": "and", "start": 167.77, "end": 168.07}, {"text": "stood", "start": 168.07, "end": 168.31}, {"text": "resolutely", "start": 168.31, "end": 168.79}, {"text": "facing", "start": 168.79, "end": 169.31}, {"text": "the", "start": 169.31, "end": 169.49}, {"text": "opposite", "start": 169.49, "end": 169.79}, {"text": "direction.", "start": 169.87, "end": 170.89}]}, {"id": 70, "startTime": 170.89, "endTime": 172.97, "fullText": "That ship hated me, he said dejectedly,", "words": [{"text": "That", "start": 170.89, "end": 171.09}, {"text": "ship", "start": 171.09, "end": 171.29}, {"text": "hated", "start": 171.29, "end": 171.53}, {"text": "me,", "start": 171.53, "end": 171.87}, {"text": "he", "start": 171.87, "end": 171.95}, {"text": "said", "start": 171.95, "end": 172.17}, {"text": "dejectedly,", "start": 172.17, "end": 172.97}]}, {"id": 71, "startTime": 172.97, "endTime": 174.53, "fullText": "indicating the police craft.", "words": [{"text": "indicating", "start": 172.97, "end": 173.29}, {"text": "the", "start": 173.29, "end": 173.65}, {"text": "police", "start": 173.65, "end": 173.91}, {"text": "craft.", "start": 173.91, "end": 174.53}]}, {"id": 72, "startTime": 174.53, "endTime": 177.31, "fullText": "That ship? Said Ford in sudden excitement.", "words": [{"text": "That", "start": 174.53, "end": 174.93}, {"text": "ship?", "start": 174.93, "end": 175.37}, {"text": "Said", "start": 175.37, "end": 175.87}, {"text": "Ford", "start": 175.87, "end": 176.17}, {"text": "in", "start": 175.69, "end": 176.33}, {"text": "sudden", "start": 176.33, "end": 176.59}, {"text": "excitement.", "start": 176.59, "end": 177.31}]}, {"id": 73, "startTime": 177.31, "endTime": 178.31, "fullText": "What happened to it?", "words": [{"text": "What", "start": 177.31, "end": 177.71}, {"text": "happened", "start": 177.71, "end": 177.97}, {"text": "to", "start": 177.97, "end": 178.13}, {"text": "it?", "start": 178.13, "end": 178.31}]}, {"id": 74, "startTime": 178.31, "endTime": 180.65, "fullText": "Do you know? It hated me because I talked", "words": [{"text": "Do", "start": 178.31, "end": 178.79}, {"text": "you", "start": 178.79, "end": 178.89}, {"text": "know?", "start": 178.89, "end": 179.21}, {"text": "It", "start": 179.21, "end": 179.69}, {"text": "hated", "start": 179.69, "end": 179.89}, {"text": "me", "start": 179.89, "end": 180.09}, {"text": "because", "start": 180.09, "end": 180.35}, {"text": "I", "start": 180.35, "end": 180.49}, {"text": "talked", "start": 180.49, "end": 180.65}]}, {"id": 75, "startTime": 180.65, "endTime": 182.15, "fullText": "to it. You talked to it?", "words": [{"text": "to", "start": 180.65, "end": 180.83}, {"text": "it.", "start": 180.83, "end": 181.05}, {"text": "You", "start": 181.11, "end": 181.55}, {"text": "talked", "start": 181.55, "end": 181.75}, {"text": "to", "start": 181.75, "end": 181.87}, {"text": "it?", "start": 181.87, "end": 182.15}]}, {"id": 76, "startTime": 182.15, "endTime": 184.47, "fullText": "Exclaimed Ford. What do you mean you talked to", "words": [{"text": "Exclaimed", "start": 182.15, "end": 182.85}, {"text": "Ford.", "start": 182.85, "end": 183.45}, {"text": "What", "start": 183.45, "end": 183.75}, {"text": "do", "start": 183.75, "end": 183.83}, {"text": "you", "start": 183.83, "end": 183.91}, {"text": "mean", "start": 183.91, "end": 183.99}, {"text": "you", "start": 183.99, "end": 184.13}, {"text": "talked", "start": 184.13, "end": 184.29}, {"text": "to", "start": 184.29, "end": 184.47}]}, {"id": 77, "startTime": 184.47, "endTime": 187.37, "fullText": "it? Simple. I got very bored and depressed,", "words": [{"text": "it?", "start": 184.47, "end": 184.73}, {"text": "Simple.", "start": 184.73, "end": 185.61}, {"text": "I", "start": 185.61, "end": 185.97}, {"text": "got", "start": 185.97, "end": 186.13}, {"text": "very", "start": 186.13, "end": 186.41}, {"text": "bored", "start": 186.41, "end": 186.73}, {"text": "and", "start": 186.73, "end": 186.89}, {"text": "depressed,", "start": 186.45, "end": 187.37}]}, {"id": 78, "startTime": 187.37, "endTime": 189.93, "fullText": "so I went and plugged myself into its external", "words": [{"text": "so", "start": 187.37, "end": 187.85}, {"text": "I", "start": 187.85, "end": 187.97}, {"text": "went", "start": 187.97, "end": 188.13}, {"text": "and", "start": 188.13, "end": 188.33}, {"text": "plugged", "start": 188.33, "end": 188.59}, {"text": "myself", "start": 188.59, "end": 189.05}, {"text": "into", "start": 189.05, "end": 189.35}, {"text": "its", "start": 189.35, "end": 189.55}, {"text": "external", "start": 189.55, "end": 189.93}]}, {"id": 79, "startTime": 189.93, "endTime": 192.65, "fullText": "computer feed. I talked to the computer at great", "words": [{"text": "computer", "start": 189.93, "end": 190.39}, {"text": "feed.", "start": 190.39, "end": 190.89}, {"text": "I", "start": 190.89, "end": 191.37}, {"text": "talked", "start": 191.37, "end": 191.53}, {"text": "to", "start": 191.53, "end": 191.67}, {"text": "the", "start": 191.67, "end": 191.75}, {"text": "computer", "start": 191.75, "end": 192.05}, {"text": "at", "start": 191.65, "end": 192.37}, {"text": "great", "start": 192.37, "end": 192.65}]}, {"id": 80, "startTime": 192.65, "endTime": 194.89, "fullText": "length and explained my view of the universe to", "words": [{"text": "length", "start": 192.65, "end": 192.97}, {"text": "and", "start": 192.97, "end": 193.21}, {"text": "explained", "start": 193.21, "end": 193.63}, {"text": "my", "start": 193.63, "end": 193.85}, {"text": "view", "start": 193.85, "end": 194.05}, {"text": "of", "start": 194.05, "end": 194.21}, {"text": "the", "start": 194.21, "end": 194.31}, {"text": "universe", "start": 194.31, "end": 194.63}, {"text": "to", "start": 194.63, "end": 194.89}]}, {"id": 81, "startTime": 194.89, "endTime": 197.27, "fullText": "it, said Marvin. And what happened?", "words": [{"text": "it,", "start": 194.89, "end": 195.23}, {"text": "said", "start": 195.23, "end": 195.41}, {"text": "Marvin.", "start": 195.41, "end": 195.99}, {"text": "And", "start": 195.99, "end": 196.39}, {"text": "what", "start": 196.39, "end": 196.51}, {"text": "happened?", "start": 196.51, "end": 197.27}]}, {"id": 82, "startTime": 197.33, "endTime": 200.57, "fullText": "Pressed for it. It committed suicide, said Marvin and", "words": [{"text": "Pressed", "start": 197.33, "end": 197.63}, {"text": "for", "start": 197.63, "end": 197.83}, {"text": "it.", "start": 197.83, "end": 198.11}, {"text": "It", "start": 198.37, "end": 198.51}, {"text": "committed", "start": 198.51, "end": 198.75}, {"text": "suicide,", "start": 198.75, "end": 199.71}, {"text": "said", "start": 199.71, "end": 200.03}, {"text": "Marvin", "start": 200.03, "end": 200.33}, {"text": "and", "start": 200.33, "end": 200.57}]}, {"id": 83, "startTime": 200.57, "endTime": 202.69, "fullText": "stalked off back to the heart of gold.", "words": [{"text": "stalked", "start": 200.57, "end": 201.01}, {"text": "off", "start": 201.01, "end": 201.11}, {"text": "back", "start": 201.11, "end": 201.33}, {"text": "to", "start": 201.33, "end": 201.47}, {"text": "the", "start": 201.47, "end": 201.59}, {"text": "heart", "start": 201.59, "end": 202.19}, {"text": "of", "start": 202.19, "end": 202.31}, {"text": "gold.", "start": 202.31, "end": 202.69}]}], "primaryColor": "#111111", "mutedColor": "#c8c8c8", "backgroundColor": "#faf9f6", "fontFamily": "Playfair Display, Georgia, Garamond, serif", "mode": "cumulative"}